#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:2
msgid "Troubleshooting slow builds"
msgstr "排查构建缓慢问题"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:4
msgid ""
"This page contains a list of the most common issues that are slowing down "
"builds."
msgstr "本页列出拖慢构建的最常见问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:6
msgid ""
"In case you are waiting a long time for your builds to finish or your builds"
" are terminated by exceeding general resource limits, this troubleshooting "
"guide will help you resolve some of the most common issues causing slow "
"builds. Even if you are not facing any immediate performance issues, it's "
"always good to be familiar with the most common ones."
msgstr "若你等待构建完成耗时过长，或构建因超出通用资源限制而被终止，本排查指南可帮你解决导致构建缓慢的若干常见问题。即使你当前没有性能问题，熟悉这些常见问题也总有好处。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:12
msgid ""
"Build resources on Read the Docs are limited to make sure that users don't "
"overwhelm our build systems. The current build limits can be found on our "
":ref:`Build resources reference <builds:Build resources>`."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 上的构建资源有限制，以确保用户不会压垮我们的构建系统。当前构建限制见我们的 :ref:`构建资源参考 "
"<builds:Build resources>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/contribute-to-troubleshooting.rst:3
msgid ""
"Please help us keep this section updated and contribute your own error "
"resolutions, performance improvements, etc. Send in your helpful comments or"
" ideas 💡 to support@readthedocs.org or contribute directly by clicking "
":guilabel:`Edit on GitHub` in the top right corner of this page."
msgstr ""
"请帮助我们保持本节内容更新，贡献你自己的错误解决方案、性能改进等。将你的宝贵建议或想法 💡 发送至 "
"support@readthedocs.org，或直接点击本页右上角的 :guilabel:`Edit on GitHub` 提交贡献。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:18
msgid "Reduce formats you're building"
msgstr "减少构建的格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:20
msgid ""
"You can change the formats of docs that you're building with our :doc"
":`/config-file/index`, see :ref:`config-file/v2:formats`."
msgstr "你可以通过 :doc:`/config-file/index` 更改构建的文档格式，参见 :ref:`config-file/v2:formats` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:23
msgid ""
"In particular, the ``htmlzip`` takes up a decent amount of memory and time, "
"so disabling that format might solve your problem."
msgstr "特别是 ``htmlzip`` 会占用相当多的内存和时间，禁用该格式或许能解决你的问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:27
msgid "Reduce documentation build dependencies"
msgstr "减少文档构建依赖"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:29
msgid ""
"A lot of projects reuse their requirements file for their documentation "
"builds. If there are extra packages that you don't need for building docs, "
"you can create a custom requirements file just for documentation. This "
"should speed up your documentation builds, as well as reduce your memory "
"footprint."
msgstr ""
"许多项目复用其 requirements 文件进行文档构建。若其中有构建文档并不需要的额外包，可为文档单独创建自定义 requirements "
"文件。这能加快文档构建并减少内存占用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:36
msgid "Use mamba instead of conda"
msgstr "用 mamba 替代 conda"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you need conda packages to build your documentation, you can :ref:`use "
"mamba as a drop-in replacement to conda <guides/conda:Making builds faster "
"with mamba>`, which requires less memory and is noticeably faster."
msgstr ""
"若构建文档需要 conda 包，可 :ref:`用 mamba 直接替代 conda <guides/conda:Making builds "
"faster with mamba>` ，它内存占用更少且明显更快。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:43
msgid "Document Python modules API statically"
msgstr "静态生成 Python 模块 API 文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:45
msgid ""
"If you are installing a lot of Python dependencies just to document your "
"Python modules API using ``sphinx.ext.autodoc``, you can give a try to "
"`sphinx-autoapi`_ Sphinx's extension instead which should produce the exact "
"same output but running statically. This could drastically reduce the memory"
" and bandwidth required to build your docs."
msgstr ""
"若你仅为用 ``sphinx.ext.autodoc`` 生成 Python 模块 API 文档而安装大量 Python 依赖，可改用 Sphinx "
"扩展 `sphinx-autoapi`_ ，它输出完全相同但以静态方式运行，能大幅减少构建文档所需的内存和带宽。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:52
msgid "Requests more resources"
msgstr "申请更多资源"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build-using-too-many-resources.rst:54
msgid ""
"If you still have problems building your documentation, we can increase "
"build limits on a per-project basis, sending an email to "
"support@readthedocs.org providing a good reason why your documentation needs"
" more resources."
msgstr "若构建文档仍有问题，我们可按项目提高构建限制。请发送邮件至 support@readthedocs.org，并说明文档需要更多资源的充分理由。"

